id: ops-pksh
title: Self-hosted pm-changelog is reported not ready because it does not depend on itself
description: "A real packed pm-ops scan of all 21 TypeScript package workspaces returned 20 ready and rejected only pm-changelog. That package generates and checks its own changelog through its declared local CLI, so requiring a dependency on itself produces a false readiness failure. Scan, status, and the default wiring policy must recognize the explicit self-hosted setup while preserving the dependency observation and refusing incomplete wiring."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-07T23:28:48.518Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-22T12:22:49.668Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-21T18:55:03.345Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-21T18:55:03.345Z"
author: codex-pm-release
acceptance_criteria: The real self-hosted package passes changelog wiring in scan status and default policy; dependency metadata remains truthful; name-only and incomplete CLI generation/check configurations remain rejected; regression tests and exact all-source coverage pass.
repro_steps: "Scan self-hosted pm-changelog with its declared dist/cli.js binary, changelog:full generator and matching changelog:check script, without adding a dependency on itself. Evidence: index.ts, README.md, test/ops.test.ts."
resolution: "Reverified main 5804578: PR #101 (78428f5) recognizes the self-hosted pm-changelog declared local CLI and generation/check scripts without requiring a self-dependency. Scan, status and default policy accept complete wiring while preserving has_pm_changelog=false and rejecting name-only, missing or malformed configurations. Evidence: index.ts selfHostsPmChangelog and its consumers, README.md and test/ops.test.ts self-hosted wiring regression."
expected_result: Self-hosted changelog readiness recognizes its own generator without a self-dependency.
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-07T23:38:40.186Z",codex-pm-release,"Regression proof: the original packed package returned only 20 of 21 real TypeScript workspaces ready because pm-changelog has no self-dependency. The corrected packed package now returns 21 of 21 ready online; pm-changelog keeps has_pm_changelog=false and reports self_hosts_pm_changelog=true. Its real status is ready and all six default policy checks pass. Nine incomplete configurations and an explicit custom required-script policy are covered by the host harness; three malformed configurations were also rejected through the installed packed CLI. Full release:check passed 466 tests with zero failures and two optional real-data tests skipped, exact all-source 100/100/100/100 on 13 files, and docstrings on all 185 declarations. Types, production audit, package contents, changelog, release-date and publish-attestation gates passed. The manual fleet scan and metrics commands supplied the separate real-data evidence."
  "2026-10-22T12:22:49.668Z",codex-agent,"PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M6vCj0E is valid. Main 5804578 retains delivery 78428f5 and selfHostsPmChangelog plus positive/negative scan, status and policy assertions. Both resolution and close_reason now describe self-hosting, not unrelated artifact lookups. Existing closed state and original completion receipt are retained; no new closure or runtime certification is performed."
